// EXPECTED: compile error
// expect-error: array index: this constant reads differently signed and unsigned
// BUG-1063: the INDEX sink of BUG-1018's divergent-reading refusal. `-4 / -2` is 2
// read signed and 0 read as the u32 its literals are. The index position used to
// render the signed reading and was left alone as "self-consistent"; once literal
// rendering followed the checker type everywhere (BUG-1063) it rendered the
// unsigned one instead — silently picking a reading, which every other sink refuses.
u32 main() {
    u32[4] a;
    a[2] = 7;
    return a[-4 / -2];
}
